V72x46_height_3507-3516_P2SAoM40_Phan85Ma1500_2_<hash>-YYYY-MM-DD_wtd.nc - netcdf file of cover-
V72x46_laimax_3507-3516_P2SAoM40_Phan85Ma1500_2_<hash>-YYYY-MM-DD_lcwtd.pdf
